 "verdict": "include",
 "verdict_reason": "Borderline include. Own replication with fully independent references: leave-one-replicate-out AUROC 0.68-0.71 (>=0.65), single-vs-single 0.63 (shared-reference recipe 0.69 / LOO 0.73-0.78, inflated). Same-line cross-study supports the labels: Flister 2025 HT-29 (65 shared pairs) scores our 4 positives at AUROC 0.98 and our score ranks their 16 'Lethal' pairs at AUROC 0.72; Dede 2020 HT-29 (11 pairs) 1.0 both ways (3-4 pos). No contradiction (no overlap reaches 20 positives). Hit rate 0.34% (low end, plausible); fitness-only AUROC 0.61 after per-anchor normalisation. Caveat: cross-study evidence covers only paralog pairs; most positives are anchor x library pairs (WEE1 is a hub with 19/58) that no other study measures."
}